    "updated_at": "2022-06-14T06:38:44Z",
    "body": "Ah! That makes sense. So yes either way we will be deleting the text (#195) or I'll make a PR to edit the value. \r\nNote that for the automatic parsing https://drafts.csswg.org/css-backgrounds-4/#background-clip should give you what you need? ",
