    "body": "Safari does, Chrome doesn't yet for `-webkit-background-clip: text`. See https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1174390  \r\nhttps://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=872114",
